SESSION_*.md
CONSTITUTION.md
README.md
FRONTEND_IMPLEMENTATION_AUDIT.md
REPOSITORY_ARCHITECTURE_AND_FRONTEND_PLAN.md
docker-compose.yml
.DS_Store
